<view class="page {{theme}}"><text class="eyebrow">MAKE YOURSELF AT HOME</text><view class="title">设置与数据</view><view class="subtitle">你的酒架和回忆，只保存在这台设备。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{blocked}}" class="info">本地数据读取失败，已停止保存。请先导出原始文件留存，再导入有效备份恢复。<button class="secondary section" bindtap="raw">导出原始数据文件</button></view>
  <view class="panel section"><view class="section-title">语言 / Language</view><view class="wrap"><text class="chip {{locale === 'zh-CN' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-locale="zh-CN" bindtap="language">简体中文</text><text class="chip {{locale === 'en' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-locale="en" bindtap="language">English</text></view><view class="row section"><text>减少动态效果</text><switch checked="{{reduced}}" bindchange="motion" color="#92b58b" /></view><button class="secondary section" bindtap="intro">重看新手引导</button><bar-music locale="{{locale}}" /></view><view class="panel section"><view class="section-title">吧台外观</view><view class="wrap"><text wx:for="{{themes}}" wx:key="key" class="chip {{theme === item.key ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="theme">{{item.name}}</text></view></view>
  <view class="panel"><view class="section-title">本地数据</view><view class="row"><text class="muted">库存 / 收藏 / 自建 / 日记</text><text>{{inventory}} / {{favorites}} / {{custom}} / {{logs}}</text></view><view class="small muted section">当前约 {{size}} KB · 数据上限 3.8 MB</view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="export">导出 JSON 文件</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="copy">复制备份文本</button></view><view class="info">卸载微信、清理小程序数据或更换手机可能丢失本地记录。建议定期导出备份。导出文件包含日记与照片，请保存在你信任的位置。</view></view>
  <view class="panel"><view class="section-title">恢复 / 从网页版迁移</view><view class="muted">支持当前网页版、iOS / Mac 共用吧台导出的 JSON 备份。先验证内容，确认后再替换。</view><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="chooseFile">选择聊天中的文件</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="paste">读取剪贴板</button></view><view class="label">或直接粘贴 JSON 文本</view><textarea value="{{backupText}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="-1" placeholder="粘贴备份内容" /><button class="section" bindtap="importText">检查并导入备份</button></view>
  <view class="panel"><view class="section-title">大喝特喝 · 微信小程序版</view><view class="muted">145 款内置配方 · 本地材料匹配 · Cocktail DNA · 分步跟做 · 照片日记</view><view class="small muted section">中英文界面、离线音乐与内置配方语音、手绘瓶子、十种杯型、完整步骤动效、图片分享和本地备份。任意自建文本朗读需在小程序账号中授权微信同声传译插件。</view></view>
</view>
